# EnvironmentFile for the BTC Paper Trader systemd units.
#
# Install to /etc/btc-paper-trader/btc-paper-trader.env, owned by the service
# user, mode 600. This file is read by both the hourly and report units.
#
# It is intentionally OUTSIDE the git repo: the heartbeat URL is a credential
# (anyone holding it can forge heartbeats and keep a dead trader looking alive),
# so it is never committed. See hardening spec D3.
#
# HEARTBEAT_PING_URL is the dead-man's switch target (WS3). It is REQUIRED when
# monitoring.heartbeat.enabled is true in config.yaml (the default): startup
# fails hard if it is unset, empty, or still a placeholder. Populate it with the
# real healthchecks.io ping URL held by Ian. To run without the switch (local
# dev only), set monitoring.heartbeat.enabled: false instead.
#
# HEARTBEAT_PING_URL=https://hc-ping.com/your-uuid-here
